  content = '{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Anis ialah seorang peguam di Malaysia, manakala Ming Jun bekerja sebagai perunding di London. Kisah cinta mereka berlangsung selama lebih 10 tahun dan merentasi 2 benua. Mereka berkenalan di UK ketika di universiti dan menghabiskan sebahagian besar hubungan mereka secara jarak jauh. Apabila melihat foto perkahwinan mereka, kami benar-benar tertarik dengan emosi yang terpancar serta bagaimana pandangan mereka hanya tertumpu antara satu sama lain.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Datang daripada latar belakang yang berbeza, cabaran terbesar yang mereka hadapi adalah isu berkaitan agama. Namun setelah keluarga melihat keteguhan dan keikhlasan cinta mereka, kedua-dua keluarga akhirnya menerima hubungan itu dan memberi sokongan penuh. Semasa merancang majlis, Anis sangat terharu melihat bagaimana kedua-dua keluarga begitu bersedia dan terbuka untuk menerima adat perkahwinan masing-masing.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"“Dia melamar saya pada Disember 2019. Kami mula mencari lokasi majlis pada Januari dan Februari 2020, tetapi apabila pandemik berlaku, semua perancangan terpaksa dihentikan. Saya memang inginkan majlis perkahwinan yang lengkap, bukan sekadar nikah semasa MCO. Jadi kami memilih untuk menunggu.” – Anis. Pada awal 2022, mereka akhirnya membuat keputusan untuk meneruskan perancangan dan menetapkan perkahwinan pada bulan Jun. Anis tertawa ketika mengenang betapa kelam-kabutnya proses menyiapkan semuanya tanpa bantuan perancang perkahwinan.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-romantis-di-jen-shangri-la-puteri-harbour/1787396132002-RW-NicholasNgAnisMingJunHotelPuteriHarbour-2-681x1/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-romantis-di-jen-shangri-la-puteri-harbour/1787396133430-RW-NicholasNgAnisMingJunHotelPuteriHarbour-3/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-romantis-di-jen-shangri-la-puteri-harbour/1787396134966-RW-NicholasNgAnisMingJunHotelPuteriHarbour-4-681x1/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-romantis-di-jen-shangri-la-puteri-harbour/1787396136408-RW-NicholasNgAnisMingJunHotelPuteriHarbour-5-681x1/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-romantis-di-jen-shangri-la-puteri-harbour/1787396137904-RW-NicholasNgAnisMingJunHotelPuteriHarbour-6-681x1/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-romantis-di-jen-shangri-la-puteri-harbour/1787396139581-RW-NicholasNgAnisMingJunHotelPuteriHarbour-7/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-romantis-di-jen-shangri-la-puteri-harbour/1787396140911-RW-NicholasNgAnisMingJunHotelPuteriHarbour-8/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-romantis-di-jen-shangri-la-puteri-harbour/1787396142238-RW-NicholasNgAnisMingJunHotelPuteriHarbour-9-683x1/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-romantis-di-jen-shangri-la-puteri-harbour/1787396143877-RW-NicholasNgAnisMingJunHotelPuteriHarbour-10/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-romantis-di-jen-shangri-la-puteri-harbour/1787396145298-RW-NicholasNgAnisMingJunHotelPuteriHarbour-11/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-romantis-di-jen-shangri-la-puteri-harbour/1787396146696-RW-NicholasNgAnisMingJunHotelPuteriHarbour-12/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-romantis-di-jen-shangri-la-puteri-harbour/1787396148082-RW-NicholasNgAnisMingJunHotelPuteriHarbour-13/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"“Semasa saya bangun untuk bersiap, hujan sudah mula turun. Kami rancang buat akad nikah di luar dan berharap sangat supaya cuaca baik, tetapi tetap hujan juga. Nasib baik tempat untuk ","type":"text"},{"text":"majlis minum teh","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"rel":"noopener","href":"https://theweddingnotebook.com/inspire/ideas-and-advice/chinese-wedding-tea-ceremony-explained/","class":null,"target":"_blank"}}]},{"text":" sudah disediakan di dalam, jadi kami alihkan majlis akad nikah ke sana.” – Anis","type":"text"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-romantis-di-jen-shangri-la-puteri-harbour/1787396149473-RW-NicholasNgAnisMingJunHotelPuteriHarbour-14-681x/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-romantis-di-jen-shangri-la-puteri-harbour/1787396150975-RW-NicholasNgAnisMingJunHotelPuteriHarbour-15/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/