,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-romantis-di-jen-shangri-la-puteri-harbour/1787396163401-RW-NicholasNgAnisMingJunHotelPuteriHarbour-24/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-romantis-di-jen-shangri-la-puteri-harbour/1787396164637-RW-NicholasNgAnisMingJunHotelPuteriHarbour-25-681x/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-romantis-di-jen-shangri-la-puteri-harbour/1787396166027-RW-NicholasNgAnisMingJunHotelPuteriHarbour-26-683x/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Hujan akhirnya berhenti, dan pasangan itu bersama para tetamu bergerak ke taman atas bumbung untuk meneruskan majlis akad nikah secara ringkas. “Kami mahu gaya yang nampak natural, tapi rasa penggunaan warna putih sahaja terlalu biasa. Jadi kami tambah warna blush dalam tema warna,” kata Anis. Di ruang dalam bangunan, mereka menggunakan tema warna yang sama, cuma susunan bunga diubah sedikit supaya suasananya tetap kelihatan elegan dan menarik.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-romantis-di-jen-shangri-la-puteri-harbour/1787396167411-RW-NicholasNgAnisMingJunHotelPuteriHarbour-27/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-romantis-di-jen-shangri-la-puteri-harbour/1787396168839-RW-NicholasNgAnisMingJunHotelPuteriHarbour-28-683x/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-romantis-di-jen-sha