n-shangri-la-puteri-harbour/1787396193416-RW-NicholasNgAnisMingJunHotelPuteriHarbour-44/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-romantis-di-jen-shangri-la-puteri-harbour/1787396194680-RW-NicholasNgAnisMingJunHotelPuteriHarbour-45/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-romantis-di-jen-shangri-la-puteri-harbour/1787396195941-RW-NicholasNgAnisMingJunHotelPuteriHarbour-46-683x/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Apabila ditanya apakah nasihat untuk bakal pengantin lain, Anis berkata, “mulakan persiapan awal.” Untuk memastikan semuanya teratur, Ming Jun yang memang mahir dengan Excelmembuat satu spreadsheet supaya mereka boleh ikut jadual dan tak terlepas apa-apa. “Kalau anda tak ambil perancang perkahwinan, pastikan anda ada keluarga dan kawan-kawan yang boleh bantu pada hari majlis. Dan walaupun kita dah rancang sebaik mungkin, tetap akan ada perkara yang tak berjalan seperti dirancang (macam hujan masa majlis kami). Jadi saya ingatkan diri sendiri untuk kekal positif dan nikmati hari itu dan saya berjaya!”","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Lokasi: ","type":"text"},{"text":"JEN by Shangri-La, Puteri Harbour","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"rel":"noopener","href":"https://www.shangri-la.com/en/find-a-hotel/","class":null,"target":"_blank"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Jurugambar: ","type":"text"},{"text":"Nicholas Ng @nicholas_nyy","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"rel":"noopener","href":"https://theweddingnotebook.com/inspire/vendor/photographers/nicholas-ng-photography/","class":null,"target":"_blank"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Juruvideo: ","type":"text"},{"text":"Nig