  content = '{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Nailah dan Hakim pada mulanya bertemu ketika ketika bekerja sebagai wartawan di Astro AWANI. Perjalanan cinta mereka bermula semasa mereka berganding sebagai pengacara sebuah program pagi pada tahun 2019. Di sebalik kamera, keserasian itu bertukar menjadi perasaan cinta yang sebenar. Walaupun kerja sebagai pembaca berita sangat sibuk dan mencabar, rutin bangun awal serta masa yang dihabiskan bersama di studio menjadikan hubungan mereka semakin rapat. Kini, kedua-duanya sedang menyambung pengajian di peringkat Sarjana di University of Warwick. Di sinilah Nailah dan Hakim berkongsi kisah tentang hari perkahwinan mereka.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-indah-di-laman-fajar-menyinsing-port-dickson/1787396035564-RW-CandidNailahHakimVillaPortDickson-2/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-indah-di-laman-fajar-menyinsing-port-dickson/1787396037557-RW-CandidNailahHakimVillaPortDickson-3-683x1024/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-indah-di-laman-fajar-menyinsing-port-dickson/1787396043520-RW-CandidNailahHakimVillaPortDickson-4-683x1024/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-indah-di-laman-fajar-menyinsing-port-dickson/1787396049943-RW-CandidNailahHakimVillaPortDickson-5-1024x683/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Kisah mereka bermula pada tahun 2020, semasa pandemik. Ketika itu mereka mula berkenalan dan keluar secara diam-diam, meluangkan masa bersama ketika waktu makan di tempat kerja atau berbual melalui FaceTime. Hubungan yang terjalin dalam tempoh PKP itu akhirnya membawa kepada lamaran yang sangat indah di Kota Kinabalu pada April 2022.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-indah-di-laman-fajar-menyinsing-port-dickson/1787396053870-RW-CandidNailahHakimVillaPortDickson-6-683x1024/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Nailah dan Hakim memilih Fajar Menyinsing di Port Dickson sebagai lokasi perkahwinan mereka kerana tertarik dengan keindahan rumah kampung kayu asal dan akses pantai persendirian. Mereka mahukan majlis yang sederhana dan lebih dekat dengan tetamu, dengan 100 orang hadir untuk majlis Nikah dan sekitar 300 orang untuk majlis resepsi pada sebelah petang. Rumah kampung bersejarah yang dibina sejak tahun 1900-an itu juga menjadi tarikan utama. Keunikan rumah tersebut memberi sentuhan istimewa dan akhirnya mereka jadikan rumah kampung tersebut sebagai elemen utama pada kad jemputan perkahwinan mereka.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-indah-di-laman-fajar-menyinsing-port-dickson/1787396058881-RW-CandidNailahHakimVillaPortDickson-7-683x1024/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-indah-di-laman-fajar-menyinsing-port-dickson/1787396063685-RW-CandidNailahHakimVillaPortDickson-8/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Pasangan ini mendapat inspirasi daripada suasana semula jadi di lokasi itu dan bekerjasama rapat dengan dekorator mereka, Abang Nas dari Munstara. Laman di Fajar Menyinsing dihias cantik dengan bunga-bunga berwarna terang yang menyerlah, kontras dengan rupa rumah tradisional serta tona semula jadi persekitarannya.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-indah-di-laman-fajar-menyinsing-port-dickson/1787396065125-RW-CandidNailahHakimVillaPortDickson-9/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-indah-di-laman-fajar-menyinsing-port-dickson/1787396066526-RW-CandidNailahHakimVillaPortDickson-10/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-indah-di-laman-fajar-menyinsing-port-dickson/1787396067971-RW-CandidNailahHakimVillaPortDickson-11/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-indah-di-laman-fajar-menyinsing-port-dickson/1787396069316-RW-CandidNailahHakimVillaPortDickson-12/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-indah-di-laman-fajar-menyinsing-port-dickson/1787396070674-RW-CandidNailahHakimVillaPortDickson-13/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-indah-di-laman-fajar-menyinsing-port-dickson/1787396072810-RW-CandidNailahHakimVillaPortDickson-13-683x1024/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-indah-di-laman-fajar-menyinsing-port-dickson/1787396078381-RW-CandidNailahHakimVillaPortDickson-14-683x1024/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Majlis Akad Nikah bermula dengan sedikit rasa berdebar kerana cuaca mendung, tetapi semuanya berjalan dengan baik. Hari itu dipenuhi detik penuh emosi, persembahan muzik secara langsung, dan pertukaran pakaian yang lancar daripada busana tradisional kepada gaya moden dan sut linen.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-indah-di-laman-fajar-menyinsing-port-dickson/1787396083247-RW-CandidNailahHakimVillaPortDickson-14/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-indah-di-laman-fajar-menyinsing-port-dickson/1787396084662-RW-CandidNailahHakimVillaPortDickson-15/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-indah-di-laman-fajar-menyinsing-port-dickson/1787396085996-RW-CandidNailahHakimVillaPortDickson-16/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-indah-di-laman-fajar-menyinsing-port-dickson/1787396087352-RW-CandidNailahHakimVillaPortDickson-17/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-indah-di-laman-fajar-menyinsing-port-dickson/1787396089228-RW-CandidNailahHakimVillaPortDickson-18-683x1024/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-indah-di-laman-fajar-menyinsing-port-dickson/1787396093439-RW-CandidNailahHakimVillaPortDickson-19/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-indah-di-laman-fajar-menyinsing-port-dickson/1787396094767-RW-CandidNailahHakimVillaPortDickson-20/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-indah-di-laman-fajar-menyinsing-port-dickson/1787396095989-RW-CandidNailahHakimVillaPortDickson-21/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Untuk majlis resepsi pada petang itu, Nailah dan Hakim menukar pakaian dan membuat kemunculan masuk sambil diiringi lagu ‘Can’t Take My Eyes Off Of You’, , sambil menyapa tetamu yang hadir dalam jumlah lebih ramai. Payung kertas yang pada awalnya hanya untuk hiasan akhirnya menjadi berguna apabila matahari muncul secara tiba-tiba.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-indah-di-laman-fajar-menyinsing-port-dickson/1787396098429-RW-CandidNailahHakimVillaPortDickson-22-683x1024/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-indah-di-laman-fajar-menyinsing-port-dickson/1787396102905-RW-CandidNailahHakimVillaPortDickson-23/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-indah-di-laman-fajar-menyinsing-port-dickson/1787396104307-RW-CandidNailahHakimVillaPortDickson-24/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-indah-di-laman-fajar-menyinsing-port-dickson/1787396105616-RW-CandidNailahHakimVillaPortDickson-25/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-indah-di-laman-fajar-menyinsing-port-dickson/1787396107627-RW-CandidNailahHakimVillaPortDickson-26-1024x683/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Melihat rakan dan keluarga berkumpul di bawah teduhan, ketawa dan mengambil gambar pasangan pengantin di laman yang cantik, melengkapkan suasana daripada majlis pagi yang penuh emosi kepada resepsi petang yang meriah.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-indah-di-laman-fajar-menyinsing-port-dickson/1787396110922-RW-CandidNailahHakimVillaPortDickson-27/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-indah-di-laman-fajar-menyinsing-port-dickson/1787396112188-RW-CandidNailahHakimVillaPortDickson-28/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Para tetamu dijamu dengan pelbagai hidangan Negeri Sembilan yang dipilih khas, dan ia juga merupakan makanan kegemaran pengantin perempuan. Kedua-dua sajian katering dan kek disediakan oleh vendor tempatan. “Salah satu perkara yang saya paling seronok semasa merancang perkahwinan ialah berpeluang menemui ramai vendor tempatan yang berbakat,” kongsi Nailah.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-indah-di-laman-fajar-menyinsing-port-dickson/1787396114838-RW-CandidNailahHakimVillaPortDickson-28-1024x683/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-indah-di-laman-fajar-menyinsing-port-dickson/1787396118392-RW-CandidNailahHakimVillaPortDickson-29/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-indah-di-laman-fajar-menyinsing-port-dickson/1787396119824-RW-CandidNailahHakimVillaPortDickson-30/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Para tetamu dihiburkan dengan persembahan muzik secara langsung oleh rakan-rakan zaman kecil Nailah, yang juga pernah bermain muzik bersama ketika mereka membesar. Mereka mengambil masa beberapa bulan untuk memilih lagu yang sesuai, termasuk lagu kegemaran pasangan itu. Band tersebut memainkan ","type":"text"},{"text":"Pluto Projector","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"italic"}]},{"text":" oleh Rex Orange County ketika pasangan itu berjalan masuk, ","type":"text"},{"text":"Siboh Kitak Nangis","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"italic"}]},{"text":" oleh Zee Avi semasa acara menyarung cincin, dan ","type":"text"},{"text":"Lovesong","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"italic"}]},{"text":" oleh The Cure ketika memotong kek. Bagi Nailah, muzik pada hari perkahwinannya bukan sekadar hiasan. Ia adalah cerita yang penuh kenangan dan makna peribadi yang sangat dekat di hati.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-indah-di-laman-fajar-menyinsing-port-dickson/1787396121094-RW-CandidNailahHakimVillaPortDickson-31/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-indah-di-laman-fajar-menyinsing-port-dickson/1787396122409-RW-CandidNailahHakimVillaPortDickson-32/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-indah-di-laman-fajar-menyinsing-port-dickson/1787396123785-RW-CandidNailahHakimVillaPortDickson-33/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-indah-di-laman-fajar-menyinsing-port-dickson/1787396125073-RW-CandidNailahHakimVillaPortDickson-34/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Kredit Vendor","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Venue: Fajar Menyinsing, Port Dickson","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Jurugambar: Candid Pictures Studio","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Juruvideo: Candid Pictures Studio","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Penghias: Munstara Event","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Floris: Munstara Event","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Gaun Pengantin (1): Tangsi Tujuh","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Gaun Pengantin (2): Nurita Harith","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Dandan Rambut & Solekan: Zara Hunny","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Kasut Pengantin","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"rel":"noopener","href":"https://theweddingnotebook.com/inspire/fashion-and-beauty/stylish-brands-for-wedding-shoes-on-a-budget/","class":null,"target":"_blank"}}]},{"text":": Nelissa Hilman","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Sut Pengantin Lelaki: NR Exclusive","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Persembahan: Rakan zaman kanak-kanak pengantin perempuan (live band)","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Kek: Backer Galerie","type":"text"}]}]}'::jsonb
