  cover_image_detection_data = '{"faces":{"disabled":"rekognition"},"labels":{"disabled":"rekognition"}}'::jsonb,
  content = '{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Inas dan Khairul berkenalan di Muzikal P. Ramlee di PJPac, ketika Khairul bermain trompet di pentas. Inas, yang duduk sendirian dalam kalangan penonton, tidak pernah terfikir bahawa pemuzik berbakat itu akan menjadi suaminya suatu hari nanti. Percintaan mereka terjalin dengan begitu pantas, dan belum pun mencecah 11 bulan, mereka sudah pun membuat persiapan untuk hari perkahwinan mereka.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-taman-kebun-yang-minimalis-di-hulu-langat/1787395980927-RW-AmeirFikriInasKhairulTemaKahwinMelayuKlasik-2-1/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-taman-kebun-yang-minimalis-di-hulu-langat/1787395982779-RW-AmeirFikriInasKhairulTemaKahwinMelayuKlasik-3-1/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Pada awalnya, pasangan ini sudah memilih lokasi lain. Namun mereka secara tidak sengaja menemui tempat perkahwinan ini di Instagram. Tertarik dengan suasananya, mereka membuat keputusan untuk melawat lokasi tersebut dan terus jatuh hati. Di kawasan itu terdapat kebun buah-buahan yang indah, sungai yang tenang dan sebuah rumah tradisional Melayu yang cantik.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-taman-kebun-yang-minimalis-di-hulu-langat/1787395985116-RW-AmeirFikriInasKhairulTemaKahwinMelayuKlasik-4-6/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-taman-kebun-yang-minimalis-di-hulu-langat/1787395987516-RW-AmeirFikriInasKhairulTemaKahwinMelayuKlasik-5-6/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-taman-kebun-yang-minimalis-di-hulu-langat/1787395989766-RW-AmeirFikriInasKhairulTemaKahwinMelayuKlasik-6-1/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-taman-kebun-yang-minimalis-di-hulu-langat/1787395992235-RW-AmeirFikriInasKhairulTemaKahwinMelayuKlasik-7-1/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Pada hari istimewa mereka, Inas dan Khairul mengekalkan sentuhan tradisi Melayu dengan majlis Nikah pada waktu pagi. Selepas itu, mereka mengadakan dua majlis resepsi yang lebih santai, satu semasa makan tengah hari dan satu lagi pada waktu minum petang. Hiasan majlis menggunakan warna lembut dan semula jadi dengan gabungan putih dan hijau, menonjolkan suasana segar dan sederhana. Tema keseluruhannya adalah gabungan harmoni antara alam semula jadi dan tradisi, menjadikan suasana majlis tampak tenang dan sangat indah.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-taman-kebun-yang-minimalis-di-hulu-langat/1787395994654-RW-AmeirFikriInasKhairulTemaKahwinMelayuKlasik-8-6/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-taman-kebun-yang-minimalis-di-hulu-langat/1787395997577-RW-AmeirFikriInasKhairulTemaKahwinMelayuKlasik-9-6/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-taman-kebun-yang-minimalis-di-hulu-langat/1787395999785-RW-AmeirFikriInasKhairulTemaKahwinMelayuKlasik-10-/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-taman-kebun-yang-minimalis-di-hulu-langat/1787396001939-RW-AmeirFikriInasKhairulTemaKahwinMelayuKlasik-11-/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-taman-kebun-yang-minimalis-di-hulu-langat/1787396005247-RW-AmeirFikriInasKhairulTemaKahwinMelayuKlasik-12-/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-taman-kebun-yang-minimalis-di-hulu-langat/1787396007241-RW-AmeirFikriInasKhairulTemaKahwinMelayuKlasik-13-/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Hari bersejarah itu dimulakan dengan majlis Akad Nikah, disaksikan oleh ahli keluarga terdekat. Cuaca pada mulanya kelihatan tidak menentu, tetapi sebaik sahaja majlis bermula, langit kembali cerah dan cahaya matahari serta rama-rama seolah-olah turut meraikan penyatuan mereka. Ia benar-benar detik yang sangat istimewa dan menjadi pembuka yang indah untuk hari itu. Selepas Nikah, majlis makan tengah hari diteruskan. Kakak Inas, Irani, membuat persembahan silat bersama rakannya, Hani, sehingga membuatkan Inas sebak dan mengalirkan air mata. Alunan Gamelan yang menenangkan pula menghidupkan suasana dengan penuh budaya dan rasa yang menyentuh hati.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-taman-kebun-yang-minimalis-di-hulu-langat/1787396009161-RW-AmeirFikriInasKhairulTemaKahwinMelayuKlasik-15-/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-taman-kebun-yang-minimalis-di-hulu-langat/1787396011444-RW-AmeirFikriInasKhairulTemaKahwinMelayuKlasik-16-/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-taman-kebun-yang-minimalis-di-hulu-langat/1787396014156-RW-AmeirFikriInasKhairulTemaKahwinMelayuKlasik-17-/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-taman-kebun-yang-minimalis-di-hulu-langat/1787396016951-RW-AmeirFikriInasKhairulTemaKahwinMelayuKlasik-18-/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-taman-kebun-yang-minimalis-di-hulu-langat/1787396019858-RW-AmeirFikriInasKhairulTemaKahwinMelayuKlasik-19-/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Majlis resepsi waktu minum petang bermula dengan hujan renyai yang menambahkan lagi suasana romantik. Russell, rakan baik Khairul, menjadi pengacara majlis dan memastikan semuanya berjalan dengan teratur. Salah satu detik yang paling diingati ialah persembahan duet gitar dan trompet membawakan lagu “Getaran Jiwa” oleh P. Ramlee, dimainkan oleh Rizal dan Khairul sebagai kenangan bagaimana kisah mereka bermula. Majlis diteruskan dengan hidangan lazat daripada The Supper Club, ucapan penuh emosi daripada keluarga, serta persembahan muzik oleh rakan-rakan mereka iaitu Lewy, Russell dan Rizal.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-taman-kebun-yang-minimalis-di-hulu-langat/1787396021960-RW-AmeirFikriInasKhairulTemaKahwinMelayuKlasik-20-/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-taman-kebun-yang-minimalis-di-hulu-langat/1787396024185-RW-AmeirFikriInasKhairulTemaKahwinMelayuKlasik-21-/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/perkahwinan-taman-kebun-yang-minimalis-di-hulu-langat/1787396026666-RW-AmeirFikriInasKhairulTemaKahwinMelayuKlasik-22-/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":null,"data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Inas dan Khairul menasihatkan pasangan bakal berkahwin supaya menikmati proses merancang majlis bersama. Bagi mereka, penting untuk menghargai setiap momen kerana hari perkahwinan berlalu dengan sangat cepat. Ambil masa untuk berehat seketika dan hayati setiap detik, supaya tiada momen indah yang terlepas.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Kredit Vendor","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Lokasi: Helms Events Retreat","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Jurugambar: Ameir Fikri","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Juruvideo: @lydiazilan @khairulshafit","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Penyelaras Perkahwinan","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"rel":"noopener","href":"https://theweddingnotebook.com/inspire/ideas-and-advice/wedding-planners-and-actual-day-coordinators/","class":null,"target":"_blank"}}]},{"text":": Munchybabyevents @munchybabyevents.my","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Perekorasi: Lys Wedding Event","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Florist: Summerist.co","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Solekan: @makeover.by.charlotte","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Inai: @hennabybee_","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Kad Jemputan Kahwin: @narissia","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Gaun Pengantin (Nikah): Kimeusof","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Gaun Pengantin (Resepsi): Fétiche The Label","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Kasut Pengantin","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"rel":"noopener","href":"https://theweddingnotebook.com/inspire/fashion-and-beauty/stylish-brands-for-wedding-shoes-on-a-budget/","class":null,"target":"_blank"}}]},{"text":": Nikah: TS Lim (Kasut Manik Melaka), Steve Madden","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Barang Kemas: Heirloom","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Gaun Bridesmaid: The Backstitch Studio","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Suit Pengantin Lelaki: Sacoor Brothers","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Gaun Bridesmaid: The Backstitch Studio","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Suit Pengantin Lelaki: Sacoor Brothers","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Kasut Pengantin Lelaki: Clarks","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Persembahan: Akar Seni Malaysia (gamelan), adik-beradik dan rakan pengantin (silat), @rizaltony (muzik)","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Kek: Baked by Yours Truly","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Katering: The Supper Club","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph"}]}'::jsonb
