n, Penggayaan Perkahwinan, Dekorasi","type":"text"},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"text":"Lokasi:","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"text":" Beroperasi dari Selangor","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Dengan latar belakang seni bina, Kayangan Gallery pakar mengubah ruang kosong menjadi dewan perkahwinan yang dramatik dan mewah.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Wedding planner terbaik di Malaysia ini sangat sesuai untuk majlis berskala sederhana hingga besar dengan konsep dekorasi tersendiri.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Instagram","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":":","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"@kayangangallery","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"rel":"noopener","href":"https://www.instagram.com/kayangangallery/","class":null,"target":"_blank"}}]}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3},"content":[{"text":"Weddings by Emma","type":"text"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/wedding-planner-terbaik-di-malaysia/1787395697999-IN_E2_80_94WeddingPlannerTerbaikdiMalaysia-Wedding/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":"source: Weddings by Emma","data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Perkhidmatan:","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"text":" Perancangan Perkahwinan, Koordinasi Hari Majlis","type":"text"},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"text":"Lokasi:","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"text":" Beroperasi dari Klang","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Weddings by Emma percaya perkahwinan bukan sekadar tema dan dekorasi, tetapi satu pengalaman menyeluruh.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Setiap majlis direka dengan gabungan perincian intim dan gaya peribadi yang meninggalkan kesan mendalam kepada tetamu.","t