xt","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"text":" Perancangan Perkahwinan, Penggayaan Perkahwinan, Koordinasi Hari Majlis","type":"text"},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"text":"Lokasi:","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"text":" Beroperasi dari Shah Alam","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Diasaskan oleh Sherly, Tie the Knot menekankan sentuhan ringkas tetapi berimpak besar.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Berbekalkan pengalaman luas, mereka membuktikan khidmat wedding planner terbaik di Malaysia kini satu keperluan penting bagi memastikan majlis berjalan sempurna.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Instagram","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":":","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"text":"  ","type":"text"},{"text":"@tietheknot.my","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"rel":"noreferrer noopener","href":"https://www.instagram.com/tietheknot.my/","class":null,"target":"_blank"}}]}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3},"content":[{"text":"Flair Designs","type":"text"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/wedding-planner-terbaik-di-malaysia/1787395704140-IN_E2_80_94WeddingPlannerTerbaikdiMalaysia-FlairDe/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":"source: Flair Designs","data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Perkhidmatan:","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"text":" Perancangan Perkahwinan, Penggayaan Perkahwinan, Koordinasi Hari Majlis","type":"text"},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"text":"Lokasi:","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"text":" Beroperasi dari Kuala Lumpur","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Flair Design ialah gabungan dinamik pasangan suami isteri yang aktif dalam industri dekorasi perkahwinan di Kuala Lumpur.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Mereka p