amin berskala besar, penggunaan fabrik berkualiti serta pencahayaan dramatik menjadi kekuatan utama mereka.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Keunikan Jasamoure terletak pada kebolehan mencipta suasana majlis yang tampak grand dan premium, sesuai untuk pasangan yang ingin majlis perkahwinan kelihatan menonjol dan berkelas.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Instagram","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":":","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"@jasamoureweddingconcept","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"rel":"noopener","href":"https://www.instagram.com/jasamoureweddingconcept/?hl=en","class":null,"target":"_blank"}}]}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"text":"KL Wedding Ministry","type":"text"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"wedding planner terbaik di malaysia","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/wedding-planner-terbaik-di-malaysia/1787395712818-IN_E2_80_94WeddingPlannerTerbaikdiMalaysia-KLWeddi/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":"source: KL Wedding Ministry","data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Perkhidmatan:","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"text":" Perancangan Perkahwinan, Penggayaan Perkahwinan, Koordinasi Hari Majlis","type":"text"},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"text":"Lokasi:","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"text":" Beroperasi dari Kuala Lumpur","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"KL Wedding Ministry dikenali dengan pendekatan yang minimal, moden dan tersusun rapi. Setiap dekorasi dirancang dengan teliti agar kelihatan kemas tanpa elemen berlebihan.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Mereka sesuai untuk pasangan yang mengutamakan rekaan ringkas tetapi sofistikated, sama ada untuk majlis di hotel, dewan atau ruang tertutup.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Instagram","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":":","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"@klweddingministry","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"rel":"noopener","href":"https://www.instagram.com/klweddingministry/?hl=en","class":null,"target":"_blank"}}]}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"text":"MAJHLIS","type":"text"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"wedding planner terbaik di malaysia","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/wedding-planner-terbaik-di-malaysia/1787395714247-IN_E2_80_94WeddingPlannerTerbaikdiMalaysia-MAJHLIS/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":"source: MAJHLIS","data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Perkhidmatan:","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"text":" Perancangan Perkahwinan, Penggayaan Perkahwinan, Koordinasi Hari Majlis","type":"text"},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"text":"Lokasi:","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"text":" Beroperasi dari Kuala Lumpur","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"MAJHLIS menampilkan konsep perkahwinan yang kreatif, artistik dan beridentiti kuat. Setiap rekaan mempunyai sentuhan tersendiri melalui gabungan warna, tekstur dan susunan yang unik.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Wedding planner ini menjadi pilihan pasangan yang mahukan majlis perkahwinan berbeza daripada kebiasaan, dengan elemen moden dan kontemporari yang penuh karakter.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Instagram","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":":","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"@majhlis","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"rel":"noopener","href":"https://www.instagram.com/majhlis/","class":null,"target":"_blank"}}]}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"text":"D’sanding Aziey","type":"text"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"alt":"wedding planner terbaik di malaysia","src":"https://images.hellokahwin.com/inspire/wedding-planner-terbaik-di-malaysia/1787395715663-IN_E2_80_94WeddingPlannerTerbaikdiMalaysia-Dsandin/high.webp","title":null,"data-caption":"source: D’sanding Aziey","data-caption-url":null}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Perkhidmatan:","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"text":" Perancangan Perkahwinan, Penggayaan Perkahwinan, Koordinasi Hari Majlis","type":"text"},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"text":"Lokasi:","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"text":" Beroperasi dari Perak","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"D’sanding Aziey sinonim dengan dekorasi perkahwinan berteraskan adat Melayu yang digabungkan dengan sentuhan moden.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Pelamin yang anggun, susunan bunga yang penuh serta elemen tradisional menjadikan setiap majlis tampak klasik dan kemas.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Keunikan mereka terletak pada kebolehan mengekalkan nilai budaya sambil menyesuaikan rekaan mengikut cita rasa semasa.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Instagram","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":":","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"@dsandingaziey_wedding","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"rel":"noopener","href":"https://www.instagram.com/dsandingaziey_wedding/?hl=en","class":null,"target":"_blank"}}]}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"text":"Kesimpulan","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Kesimpulannya, pemilihan wedding planner yang tepat memainkan peranan penting dalam memastikan 